You are setting up a GLOBAL, self-improving agent environment for my machine.
It must apply to every repository I open with the Cursor agent CLI (`agent`),
not one project. Goal: I write a spec, agents execute and verify their own
work, I review results, and the setup improves over time without me pointing
out mistakes. Work in phases. Stop for my approval at the end of Phases 2
